time": 1249.834, "timestamp": "00:20:49", "text": "嗯，是的，我沒有 我想。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1255.259, "timestamp": "00:20:55", "text": "請允許我這樣做。在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1256.48, "timestamp": "00:20:56", "text": "問候」。阿斯特拉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1257.671, "timestamp": "00:20:57", "text": "歡迎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1259.346, "timestamp": "00:20:59", "text": "你好，Luta。親切的問候"}]